  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4046c03ddda7a8dbeb1d3ece12cfc22b8ddb5115cf067b8f601b38b39e3d227a",
      "text": "运动鞋广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c27e0f65f403dcbe282f39195aa88c555a75e8353e2679a3b7e8baaa721b3f85",
      "text": "搞什么啊，区区下仆居然敢指使本大爷过来。\n要是无聊的事，本大爷可饶不了你？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3d0a4e85764aebdb436092b7d804603f65378eb02fd114b19d5a8da7356321e",
      "text": "是关于前几天跟您说过的运动鞋广告的事。\n样品已经送到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c0b84c2396f36b5457fdb381efc85729d130278023fa7e4fa9c04236630e12a",
      "text": "样品？那种东西本大爷才不感兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b997b87853885317f388f52e2bb997fb9e6ef5861b72d1968112190355a791",
      "text": "这是拍摄时要穿的，请您先试穿一下吧。\n来，请用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b63d5ba228d92771550528a1be3a7e6a8ed3d3812bc67d7f8e92ab38776f4f08",
      "text": "啧，真没办法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f501f44a957feed24b44474ab0be75f5414e6aa88a11e4e090504906684c2ff9",
      "text": "哼——穿起来倒还不赖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9dce08c22c85bda6163bd8be5e12aff6d6784fa2b5b8537803c2415208b88d",
      "text": "拍摄时需要您在街道、运动场\n以及慢跑道上奔跑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:107b3814c50fb16774aa874a45388fbe1b1338eba01da061f987704e1cb597c6",
      "text": "这次是大型运动用品品牌的广告。\n能出演这个广告，也就是说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf4e5a1a8faa2d732027a2008300420a00e425ad1695dd36477b7aae00eea1d0",
      "text": "也就是说本大爷是最强的！\n指名找本大爷，挺识相的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_02:1_5_040_02:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25edf432b10321f9c3fdb95e01c0fecedc4a2bb9d39bcfa9886a6442a660c19f",
      "text": "拍摄什么的，本大爷一条就能过。库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
